    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Yatak odas\u0131ndaki tabancay\u0131 E ile al ve evden \xE7\u0131k. Q
    ile k\xF6yl\xFCleri \xE7a\u011F\u0131r; YE\u015E\u0130L halkal\u0131 s\u0131\u011F\u0131na\u011Fa
    g\xF6t\xFCr. Evin arkas\u0131ndaki itfaiyeye bin, MAV\u0130 g\xF6l i\u015Faretinde
    E ile depoyu doldur. 120 saniye dolunca haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131n bitmese
    de volkan patlar. \xDC\xE7 alev ruhu dalgas\u0131n\u0131 durdur, yanan evleri
    s\xF6nd\xFCr. En az bir ev ayakta kal\u0131rsa kazan\u0131rs\u0131n; b\xFCt\xFCn
    evler y\u0131k\u0131l\u0131rsa kaybedersin. S\u0131cak lavdan uzak dur."
